From 137bfe8381bedece30b85bfbd261e57d26e42590 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jarno=20M=C3=A4kel=C3=A4?= <jarno.makela@iki.fi>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:34:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] charon-nm: Report missing private key to NetworkManager
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

When cert-source is "file" or "agent" and the corresponding key/socket
is absent, add_auth_cfg_cert() returned FALSE without setting a GError.
NMVpnServicePlugin then called g_dbus_method_invocation_take_error()
with the NULL error, which hit a GLib assertion, so no D-Bus reply
was sent.  NetworkManager waited for its call to time out with no
message.

Signed-off-by: Jarno Mäkelä <jarno.makela@iki.fi>
---
 src/charon-nm/nm/nm_service.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/charon-nm/nm/nm_service.c b/src/charon-nm/nm/nm_service.c
index e9ebe233bae..a3084ffc10b 100644
--- a/src/charon-nm/nm/nm_service.c
+++ b/src/charon-nm/nm/nm_service.c
@@ -692,6 +692,13 @@ static bool add_auth_cfg_cert(NMStrongswanPluginPrivate *priv,
 		}
 		else
 		{
+			if (!*err)
+			{
+				g_set_error(err, NM_VPN_PLUGIN_ERROR,
+							NM_VPN_PLUGIN_ERROR_BAD_ARGUMENTS,
+							agent ? "SSH agent socket is missing."
+								  : "Private key file is missing.");
+			}
 			DESTROY_IF(cert);
 			return FALSE;
 		}
